  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "In your `RealtimeResponseBody` real-time response, you can choose from mutually exclusive options. Include `promotionalOffer` in your response to provide a retention message with a promotional offer. The message identifier needs to refer to a message that doesn’t have an image, and that has a `messageState` of `APPROVED`; otherwise, the retention message fails. For more information about setting up messages, see `Upload-Message`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/RealtimeResponseBody",
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/messageState",
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Upload-Message"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For new implementations, consider using the `promotionalOfferSignatureV2` signature, which is easier to generate.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/promotionalOfferSignatureV2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For more information on generating the signatures, see `promotionalOfferSignatureV1` and `promotionalOfferSignatureV2`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/promotionalOfferSignatureV1",
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/promotionalOfferSignatureV2"
          ]
        }
      ],
